\n| float value class | normal / zero / negative-zero / subnormal / huge / NaN / Inf | all comparisons |\n\n`[x]` = differential test passes across all randomised inputs for that row\n(fixed-seed xorshift PRNG, iteration counts noted per row).\n\n## Level 0 — pure vector/scalar helpers (no pointers)\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [x] |\n|---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|\n| 1 | `c2V` | 200k random `(x,y)` bit patterns incl. NaN/Inf/subnormal/-0 | [x] |\n| 2 | `c2Sub`, `c2Add` | 200k random vector pairs, all value classes | [x] |\n| 3 | `c2Mulvs`, `c2Div` | 200k random `(vec, scalar)`; scalar incl. 0, -0, Inf, NaN | [x] |\n| 4 | `c2Dot` | 200k random pairs; incl. cancelling terms and Inf*0 | [x] |\n| 5 | `c2Det2` | 200k random pairs; incl. `area == 0` collinear cases | [x] |\n| 6 | `c2Len`, `c2Norm` | 200k random vectors; incl. zero vector, huge (overflow to Inf), subnormal | [x] |\n| 7 | `c2Neg`, `c2Skew`, `c2CCW90` | 200k random vectors; sign of zero matters | [x] |\n| 8 | `c2Maxv`, `c2Minv` | 200k random pairs; equal, NaN, +0 vs -0 | [x] |\n| 9 | `c2Clampv` | 200k random `(a, lo, hi)`; lo<hi, lo==hi, lo>hi, NaN bounds | [x] |\n| 10 | `c2RotIdentity`, `c2xIdentity` | no inputs — constant, compared field-by-field | [x] |\n| 11 | `c2Mulrv`, `c2MulrvT` | 200k random `(c2r, c2v)`; unit rotations, non-unit, zero, NaN | [x] |\n| 12 | `c2Mulrv`/`c2MulrvT` round trip | `c2MulrvT(r, c2Mulrv(r, v))` for unit `r` (both libs) | [x] |\n| 13 | `c2Mulxv` | 200k random `(c2x, c2v)`: identity / translation-only / rotation-only / both | [x] |\n\n## Level 1 — pointer / buffer helpers\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [x] |\n|---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|\n| 14 | `c2BBVerts` | 50k random AABBs, out-buffer of 8 poisoned verts (checks only 4 written, winding order) | [x] |\n| 15 | `c2MakeProxy` | `type=CIRCLE`, poisoned `c2Proxy`, 20k