GJK`, the full cross-product of options\n\nShape-type pairs (rows 36-44) each run with the full option matrix below.\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [x] |\n|---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|\n| 36 | `c2GJK` | `CIRCLE` vs `CIRCLE` | [x] |\n| 37 | `c2GJK` | `CIRCLE` vs `AABB` | [x] |\n| 38 | `c2GJK` | `CIRCLE` vs `CAPSULE` | [x] |\n| 39 | `c2GJK` | `AABB` vs `CIRCLE` | [x] |\n| 40 | `c2GJK` | `AABB` vs `AABB` | [x] |\n| 41 | `c2GJK` | `AABB` vs `CAPSULE` | [x] |\n| 42 | `c2GJK` | `CAPSULE` vs `CIRCLE` | [x] |\n| 43 | `c2GJK` | `CAPSULE` vs `AABB` | [x] |\n| 44 | `c2GJK` | `CAPSULE` vs `CAPSULE` | [x] |\n| 45 | `c2GJK` | option: `ax_ptr=NULL, bx_ptr=NULL` (identity substitution), all 9 type pairs | [x] |\n| 46 | `c2GJK` | option: explicit identity `c2x` for both (must equal row 45 exactly) | [x] |\n| 47 | `c2GJK` | option: pure translation on A, identity on B, all 9 type pairs | [x] |\n| 48 | `c2GJK` | option: pure rotation (unit `c2r` from `sincosf`) on both | [x] |\n| 49 | `c2GJK` | option: rotation + translation on both, all 9 type pairs | [x] |\n| 50 | `c2GJK` | option: non-unit / denormalised `c2r` (c,s random, not on unit circle) | [x] |\n| 51 | `c2GJK` | option: `use_radius = 1` (radius correction active) | [x] |\n| 52 | `c2GJK` | option: `use_radius = 0` (raw simplex distance) | [x] |\n| 53 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache = NULL` | [x] |\n| 54 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` cold (`count=0`), then cache contents compared field-by-field | [x] |\n| 55 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` warm — call twice with the SAME cache, both results compared | [x] |\n| 56 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` warm — call twice with shapes MOVED between calls (real warm-start use) | [x] |\n| 57 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` warm, `count=1` hand-built, in-range indices | [x] |\n| 58 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` warm, `count=2` hand-built | [x] |\n| 59 | `c2GJK` | option: `cache` warm, `count=3` hand-built | [x] |\n| 60 | `c2GJK` | option: `iterations` non-NULL — iteration count compared exactly | [x] |\n| 61 | `c2GJK` | shape: far apart (dist >> r) — separated path | [x] |\n| 62 | `c2GJK` | shape: nearly touching (dist ~ rA+rB, straddles the L480 test) | [x] |\n| 63 | `c2GJK` | shape: exactly touching | [x] |\n| 64 | `c2GJK` | shape: overlapping -> `hit=1`, `s.count==3` | [x] |\n| 65 | `c2GJK` | shape: one fully inside the other | [x] |\n| 66 | `c2GJK` | shape: coincident centres (worst-case degeneracy) | [x] |\n| 67 | `c2GJK` | shape: axis-aligned / grid-snapped coords (maximal support ties) | [x] |\n| 68 | `c2GJK` | shape: huge coordinates (1e30) — overflow to Inf inside `c2Dot` | [x] |\n| 69 | `c2GJK` | shape: tiny/subnormal coordinates (1e-40) | [x] |\n| 70 | `c2GJK` | shape: radius 0 on both (rA+rB == 0 -> L480 falls to midpoint) | [x] |\n| 71 | `c2GJK` | full random sweep: all 9 type pairs x {use_radius 0,1} x {cache NULL,cold,warm} x {4 transform modes}, 2000 random geometries each | [x] |\n\n## Level 4 — the public header entry point\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [x] |\n|---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|\n| 72 | `gjk` | `reverse = 0` (AABB vs capsule), 100k random geometries | [x] |\n| 73 | `gjk` | `reverse = 1` (capsule vs AABB), 100k random geometries | [x] |\n| 74 | `gjk` | `reverse` truthy non-1 values (`2`, `-1`, `0x7f`) | [x] |\n| 75 | `gjk` | grid-snapped integer-ish coords (ties + exact touching) | [x] |\n| 76 | `gjk` | overlapping AABB/capsule (hit path) | [x] |\n| 77 | `gjk` | separated AABB/capsule (radius-correction path) | [x] |\n| 78 | `gjk` | capsule radius 0 / huge / negative | [x] |\n| 79 | `gjk` | degenerate AABB (zero extent) and degenerate capsule (a==b) | [x] |\nEOF\n} > CONFIGS.md && wc -l CONFIGS.md && grep -c \"^| [0-9]\" CONFIGS.md","description":"Write CONFIGS.md configuration surface table"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6155,"cache_read_input_tokens":53172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6155,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3528ea46-9e11-41df-9325-94400ae6b1c3","uuid":"ade1cefe-9ff7-42a6-b861-4b80a4e5f990","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:11:57.390Z"}
